  "theorem": "Three effective Brandhorst--Hofmann full-group classes enrich the previously certified cyclic Roulleau realizations.  In particular, one K3 surface with generic NS=U+D8(-1)+D4(-1) and an effective C16 x C2 action simultaneously realizes TYPE_2 H11/16 through g^2 and TYPE_4 H10/14 through s*g."
